		"name": "Library 3-tier (DTO + MapStruct)",
		"description": "Demo collection for the Day 4 sample: three tiers, DTOs, MapStruct partial update.\n\nBefore you start:\n1. MySQL is running, spring_db / spring_user exist.\n2. From the TOP folder:  mvn install -DskipTests\n3. Start the service:    mvn -pl library-web-service spring-boot:run\n\nNo API key this time - the day 4 sample has no security, like the lab.\n\nThe folder '3. Partial update' is the lesson. Run it top to bottom: the same one-field body is sent twice, once with PATCH and once with PUT, and the results are opposite.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "newBookId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
